# project: feature-store-rollout
// Roll the central feature store out to the five ML teams: pilot with the
// recommendations team, then volunteer-order migration, then decommission
// the legacy feature pipelines.

VAR pilot_weeks = 0
VAR teams_migrated = 0

=== pilot_migration ===
Pilot with the recommendations team: migrate their top features into the central feature store.
Done when their models can read those features from the store.
* [Top features migrated] -> pilot_shadow

=== pilot_shadow ===
Run the recommendations models against the store in shadow mode and compare offline metrics with their legacy pipeline. Iterate on the store until metrics match.
~ pilot_weeks += 1
+ [Offline metrics match the legacy pipeline] -> migrate_next_team
+ {pilot_weeks < 6} [Not at parity yet, keep iterating] ~loop~ -> pilot_shadow
+ {pilot_weeks >= 6} [Six weeks without parity, escalate] -> review_board_pilot

=== review_board_pilot ===
The platform review board decides whether the store needs rework before anyone else migrates.
+ [Store needs rework first] @human -> store_rework
+ [Gap is acceptable, proceed with the rollout] @human -> migrate_next_team
+ [Halt the rollout] @human -> END

=== store_rework ===
Rework the store per the review board's findings, then re-verify against the pilot team's shadow comparison.
+ [Rework done, re-run the pilot comparison] ~loop~ -> pilot_shadow

=== migrate_next_team ===
The next volunteer team migrates its features and runs its models against the store in shadow mode until offline metrics match its legacy pipeline — the same parity bar as the pilot.
+ [Team reaches parity and goes live] -> team_live
+ [Team raises a blocking issue] @human -> review_board_migration

=== team_live ===
The team now serves features from the store; count it toward the fleet of four post-pilot migrations.
~ teams_migrated += 1
+ {teams_migrated < 4} [More teams still to migrate] ~loop~ -> migrate_next_team
+ {teams_migrated >= 4} [All five teams are on the store] -> decommission_legacy

=== review_board_migration ===
The platform review board rules on the blocking issue raised mid-migration.
+ [Issue resolved, migration resumes] @human ~loop~ -> migrate_next_team
+ [Rollout paused for store rework] @human -> store_rework

=== decommission_legacy ===
All five teams serve from the store. Each team lead confirms their old feature pipeline is safe to delete before it is decommissioned.
+ [All five team leads confirm, delete the legacy pipelines] @human -> rollout_complete
+ [A lead flags a remaining dependency] @human -> resolve_dependency

=== resolve_dependency ===
Clear the dependency blocking a legacy pipeline's deletion.
+ [Dependency cleared, resume confirmations] ~loop~ -> decommission_legacy

=== rollout_complete ===
The central feature store is the single source of features; the legacy pipelines are gone.
-> END
